      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 152 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(The Person I Admire the Most)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "The person I admire the most is Guus Hiddink, coach of the"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Korean Republic national soccer team from Holland."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "During his time as coach of the Korean team,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "he trained our soccer players very hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Even though Coach Hiddink spent a lot of time training Korea’s"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "soccer team, they were still not winning very many games."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Many people complained about him"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and blamed him for the lack of success."
    },
